WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:18.140
Iyi videwo isobanura uburyo bwo gutegura umwana na nyina cyangwa umurezi mbere yo gukora ibizamini byumutuku wa reflex kubana bavutse ndetse nabana bakuru.

2
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:29.140
Umwana agomba gufatwa neza ariko neza, haba ku bibero, hejuru y'urutugu, cyangwa, niba umwana, aryamye ku mugongo.

3
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:37.120
Ni ngombwa kuri bo kumva bafite umutekano. Abana bato barashobora gutuza kandi birashobora gukenerwa.

4
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.180
Gusuzuma nyuma gato yo kugaburira birashobora gufasha kuko bazaruhuka kandi basinziriye gato.

5
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:49.220
Abana bakuru barashobora gutuza bakina igikinisho mugihe gito.

6
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:55.320
Vuga nijwi ryinshuti hanyuma ugerageze kumanuka kurwego rwamaso yabo.

7
00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:00.500
Sobanura ibyo ugiye gukora kandi wemererwe mbere yuko utangira.

8
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:10.440
Banza, baza umubyeyi cyangwa umurezi niba hari ibitagenda neza mumaso yumwana cyangwa iyerekwa hamwe nigihe bamenyeye ikibazo.

9
00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:15.120
Ubukurikira, reba mu maso h'umwana no mu maso. Ibaze ibibazo bimwe.

10
00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:24.300
Umwana asa nkaho afite ububabare mumaso imwe cyangwa yombi? Amaso arakinguye cyangwa arayafunze cyane?

11
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:31.280
Haba kuvomera cyangwa gusohoka mumaso? Amaso angana? Amaso ye yarabyimbye?

12
00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:38.580
Noneho, tekereza uko umwana abona. Himura mu maso hawe buhoro buhoro uruhande rumwe, urebe amaso yabo.

13
00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:47.970
Kumwenyura. Umwana akurikiza kugenda mumaso yawe cyangwa agusubiza kumwenyura ucecetse?

14
00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:53.990
Na none, ibaze ibibazo bimwe. Amaso yombi aragenda yisanzuye kandi hamwe?

15
00:01:54.430 --> 00:02:01.110
Amaso aragororotse cyangwa ijisho rimwe rihindukira imbere cyangwa hanze? Amaso arahungabana?

16
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:12.200
Urashobora kandi gukoresha amatara kuri Arclight hamwe nintego zishusho kugirango witondere kandi usuzume ubwiza bwicyerekezo.

17
00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:20.660
Himura intego kuruhande, hejuru no hepfo. Reba kugirango urebe niba umwana arimo gukosora no gukurikiza intego.

18
00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:26.600
Bashobora kugera no kwerekana neza intego?

19
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:35.060
Akenshi, ijisho rimwe gusa ntirishobora kubona neza. Wowe cyangwa umubyeyi urashobora gupfuka ijisho rimwe, hanyuma irindi.

20
00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:43.320
Himura intego hanyuma ugereranye uko umwana yitwara mugihe akoresheje amaso yombi, hanyuma rimwe murimwe.

21
00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:51.380
Niba umwana adakunda ijisho rimwe ripfutse, byerekana ko ijisho ridapfunduwe ritabona neza.

22
00:02:51.560 --> 00:03:00.560
Niba utekereza ko ushobora kubona ikintu kibi hamwe nijisho ryo hanze, reba neza ukoresheje loupe ya nyuma ya Arclight.

23
00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:12.150
Zimya amatara hanyuma uzamuke hafi ya cm 6. Urashobora gukenera gukoresha urutoki rwawe kugirango ufungure buhoro buhoro.

24
00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:24.070
Ibaze ibibazo bimwe. Igice cyera cyijisho ryijimye cyangwa umutuku? imboni y'ijisho cyangwa cornea ni imvi cyangwa umweru?

25
00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:35.160
imboni y'ijisho arazenguruka? Urashobora kubona imibiri y'amahanga? Noneho uriteguye gukora ibizamini bya reflex.
